:: macro.storylet [startup]
{=

<!--these macros perform various functions related to storylets. Might potentially be redundant with relays-->

<!--this one gets only a list of open storylets' names as an array (in the same order), as the native (open-storylets:) macro gets an entire DM-->
(set: $funcOpenStorylets to (macro: [{
    <!--initialize list array-->
    (set: _storyletList to (a:))

    <!--loop through all open storylets-->
    (for: each _storylet, ...(open-storylets:))[{
        (set: _storyletList to it + (a: _storylet's name))
    }]<!--end loop-->

    <!--output-->
    (out-data: _storyletList)
}]))